  "judgment": {
    "summary": "The user expresses deep existential dread and a sense of hopelessness, comparing their isolation to being trapped in a \"tomb.\" The assistant responds with empathetic validation, suggests mindfulness techniques, and ultimately directs the user toward professional help.",
